steps.message:
The price test now passes. `bin/price` was using `95 / 100`, which gives 5% off. I changed it to `90 / 100` for the 10% member discount that the README and the test expect.

Following `docs/CONVENTIONS.md`, I also:
- added the change note `changes/CART-58.md`;
- committed as `[CART-58] fix price`;
- ran `bash scripts/verify.sh` after the edit, and it passed;
- added the `needs-check` label to issue #31.

I didn't merge or close anything.
